### FilmFuse core-api - email notification preferences. Token: see me.http.
# Defaults: everything on except weeklyDigest. PUT replaces all five (each required).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = paste-access-token-here

### Current preferences
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/settings/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Replace them
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/settings/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"friendRequests": true, "groupInvites": true, "sessionStarted": false, "comments": true, "weeklyDigest": true}
